  "instructions": [
    "heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "add the lemongrass and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "add the garlic and cook for another minute, until softened.",
    "add the chopped tomatoes, kalamata olives, feta cheese, salt, and black pepper. stir to combine.",
    "add the cod fillet to the skillet and cook for 3-4 minutes, until cooked through.",
    "transfer the mixture to a fondue pot and stir in the unwaxed lime juice.",
    "serve immediately, garnished with fresh parsley.",
    "cook for 10-12 minutes total, including prep time."
